# Spring Data JPA - Quick Example

## Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of Spring Data JPA with Hibernate to perform database operations using MySQL.

The project is developed as part of the Cognizant Deep Skilling Hands-on exercises.

---

## Hands-on Completed

- ✅ Hands-on 1 – Spring Data JPA Quick Example
- ✅ Hands-on 4 – Difference between JPA, Hibernate and Spring Data JPA

---

## Technologies Used

- Java 17
- Spring Boot 3.5.16
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate ORM
- MySQL 8.0
- Maven
- IntelliJ IDEA Community Edition

---

