## Database

Database Name

```
ormlearn
```

Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE country(
    code VARCHAR(2) PRIMARY KEY,
    name VARCHAR(50)
);
```

Sample Data

```sql
INSERT INTO country VALUES ('IN','India');
INSERT INTO country VALUES ('US','United States of America');
```

---

## Features

- Spring Boot Application
- Spring Data JPA Integration
- Hibernate ORM
- MySQL Database Connectivity
- Repository Pattern using JpaRepository
- Transaction Management using @Transactional
- Automatic SQL Generation using Hibernate

---

## Project Components

### Entity

- Country.java

Annotations Used

- @Entity
- @Table
- @Id
- @Column

---

### Repository

CountryRepository extends JpaRepository.

Provides built-in CRUD operations without writing SQL.

---

### Service

CountryService contains the business logic.

Methods

- getAllCountries()

Uses

- @Service
- @Autowired
- @Transactional

---

### Main Class

OrmLearnApplication.java

Responsibilities

- Starts Spring Boot application
- Loads Application Context
- Calls CountryService
- Displays all countries

---

