- Created a Spring Boot project using Spring Initializr
- Connected Spring Boot with MySQL
- Configured Hibernate
- Created Entity class
- Implemented Repository using JpaRepository
- Implemented Service Layer
- Retrieved records from MySQL database
- Understood the difference between JPA, Hibernate and Spring Data JPA

